 .
 The binary statically links libmdbx (Copyright 2015-2026 Leonid Yuriev, Apache-2.0, through
 reth-libmdbx and reth-mdbx-sys; its NOTICE is shipped as NOTICE.libmdbx), jemalloc
 (Copyright Jason Evans, Mozilla Foundation and Facebook, BSD-2-Clause, through
 tikv-jemalloc-sys; its licence is shipped as NOTICE.jemalloc) and the Rust
 dependencies of the default build, all under MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD, zlib, ISC, BSL-1.0 or
 Unicode-3.0 terms (or dual-licensed with one of them).

